      "Runtime: HTTP is issued from the app's main process (no CORS, no browser session). urlTemplate must hit the real API origin \u2014 do not rely on browser-only session cookies or front-end-only endpoints.",
      "allowedDomains must list every hostname used in urlTemplate (API host), not only the documentation site host.",
